; DT818_pro_v3 - 6-stream ORB rank portfolio + 6 REVERSE-hedge sub-streams
; Generated 2026-05-14. Use with ea/DT818_pro_v3.mq5 (reverse-hedge logic:
; opposite-direction LIMIT at parent entry, mirrored SL/TP).
;
; PARENT total risk: 9.0% (1.5% x 6 streams). Range filter DISABLED per WFO
; 2026-05-13 Option A (Min=0, Max=999999). Same parent geometry as v2.1 9pct.
;   S1-S3 = MAY2 R1-R3 (previous-week WFO), magics 1111/2222/3333
;   S4-S6 = MAY9 R1-R3 (current-week WFO),  magics 4444/5555/6666
;
; REVERSE-HEDGE config:
;   Direction:  OPPOSITE of parent (BUY parent SL -> SELL_LIMIT hedge; vice versa)
;   Order type: LIMIT (not STOP)
;   Entry:      Parent's original entry price
;   SL/TP:      Mirrored across entry (hedge SL on opposite side from parent SL)
;   Global expire_minutes = 720 (12h)
;   Global F1 filter      = DISABLED (max_seconds_after_entry=0)
;   Per-stream tp_mult:   inherits v2.1_h winner (S1=1.0, S2=0.75, S3=0.75,
;                                                  S4=1.0, S5=0.75, S6=0.75).
;                          v3 backfill 2026-05-11..14 used same tp_mult cfg.
;   Hedge magics: 8111/8222/8333/8444/8555/8666 (v3 reverse).
;                  7xxx reserved for v2.1_h retry-hedge legacy / log-disambiguation.
;
; Backfill 2026-05-11..14 (scripts/backfill_reverse_hedge.py against actual ticks):
;   Parent SL losses Mon-Thu: -$60,301
;   Reverse-hedge $ delta:    +$35,160  (58% recovery)
;   Per-regime:
;     NORMAL (Tue): 21/21 TP   +$21,812   (CAVEAT: tick-microstructure dependent)
;     TIGHT  (Mon+Wed): 19/22 TP, 3 SL  +$13,348
;     WIDE   (Thu LDN): 0/10 NO_FIRE   $0   (price never retraced to entry)
;
; LIVE EXECUTION CAVEAT: Tuesday's 21/21 TP relies on price briefly oscillating
; back through entry then resuming SL-direction within the 12h expire window.
; Real broker fills may be worse than the tick-mid sim. Expect 50-70% of
; modeled recovery to materialize in production = ~$22-25k vs $35k modeled.
;
; Spread guard: _MaxSpreadPts=60 (Vantage max observed 32pt; bumped 50->60 on 2026-05-15 to match SIM_SPREAD_PTS=60 in WFO friction)

; ===== Global account =====
_CapitalProtectionAmount=0.0||0.0||1||0.0||0.0||N
_RiskPct=1.5||1.5||1||1.5||1.5||N
_LotMode=1||1||1||1||1||N
